lationship-status-codes</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification"> version &#x1F4E6;0.1.0</span><table class="none"><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-relationship-status-codes.html#ahip-demo-additional-relationship-status-codes-DATI">DATI</a></td><td>Dating (in a non-committed relationship with one person or more than one person)</td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-relationship-status-codes.html#ahip-demo-additional-relationship-status-codes-MONR">MONR</a></td><td>In a committed relationship with one person but not married (monogamous relationship)</td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-relationship-status-codes.html#ahip-demo-additional-relationship-status-codes-POLY">POLY</a></td><td>In a committed relationship with more than one person (polyamorous relationship)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href="CodeSystem-AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor.html"><code>http://ahip.org/demographics/CodeSystem/AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification"> version &#x1F4E6;0.1.0</span><table class="none"><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor.html#AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor-CNTR">CNTR</a></td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td><td>**Description:**This code is to represent explicitly that the patient has chosen not to respond to this question at this time</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>
